1
00:00:00,185 --> 00:00:03,155
(Raj:)Turns out, total sweetheart.

2
00:00:03,155 --> 00:00:07,325
(Claire:)Okay, but you and I have been
keeping things casual.

3
00:00:07,326 --> 00:00:09,356
(Claire:)Uh, will you introduce me
as your friend

4
00:00:09,361 --> 00:00:10,531
(Claire:)or as your girlfriend?

5
00:00:10,529 --> 00:00:12,099
(Claire:)What if I like them

6
00:00:12,097 --> 00:00:13,227
(Claire:)and they don't like me?

7
00:00:13,231 --> 00:00:15,331
(Claire:)What if they like me
and I don't like them?

8
00:00:15,334 --> 00:00:18,164
(Raj:)Boy, it wasn't this hard
with Bon Jovi.

9
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,200
I said, “You rock,”
he said, “Thanks, man,”

10
00:00:20,205 --> 00:00:23,075
(Raj:)and that was that.

11
00:00:24,276 --> 00:00:26,446
(sniffs)

12
00:00:30,415 --> 00:00:31,815
(Penny:)Hey, you ready to go?

13
00:00:31,817 --> 00:00:33,747
(Leonard:)Hang on.
What are you doing?

14
00:00:33,752 --> 00:00:37,592
(Leonard:)Oh, I found a scratch-and-sniff
book about wine tasting.

15
00:00:38,624 --> 00:00:40,754
(Leonard:)It teaches the different
flavor notes to look for.

16
00:00:40,759 --> 00:00:42,359
(Penny:)You actually smell the wine?

17
00:00:42,361 --> 00:00:44,931
(Leonard:)I mostly just smell
my nasal spray.

18
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:47,000
(Penny:)Are your sinuses acting up?

19
00:00:46,999 --> 00:00:48,699
(Leonard:)Since my preschool got a bunny.

20
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,740
(Penny:)Hey, are you still hanging out
with Bernadette tonight?

21
00:00:51,737 --> 00:00:53,067
(Sheldon:)Yes.

22
00:00:53,071 --> 00:00:55,101
(Sheldon:)And we're going to prove
that we don't need alcohol

23
00:00:55,107 --> 00:00:56,137
(Sheldon:)to enjoy ourselves.

24
00:00:56,141 --> 00:00:57,471
(Penny:)Oh, good for you.

25
00:00:57,476 --> 00:00:59,406
(Sheldon:)Or caffeine, tobacco, sushi,

26
00:00:59,411 --> 00:01:02,081
(Sheldon:)soft cheese, processed meats
and Jacuzzis,

